###
#####

### Get all users
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users

### Get user by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users/3609

### Add a new user
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tester",
  "username": "test",
  "email": "test@metropolia.fi",
  "role": "user",
  "password": "testpassword"
}

### Update a user
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users/3609
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Tester",
  "username": "updatedtest",
  "email": "updatedtest@metropolia.fi",
  "role": "user",
  "password": "updatedtestpassword"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users/38

### Login for protected validation tests
# @name validationLogin
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "testpassword"
}

### Invalid user: empty request body
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{}

